span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>遗忘门 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定保留多少旧记忆，输入门 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定写入多少新信息，输出门则决定从细胞状态读出多少给隐状态。关键在于细胞状态的更新是「加法」而非反复相乘，梯度可以近乎无损地沿时间流动，长程依赖问题由此大幅缓解。GRU 是 LSTM 的简化版，把门合并为更新门与重置门，参数更少、在数据有限时常常更稳。</p>\n<p>这三个门如何协同，可以用一张图看清信息在细胞状态上的读写路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    X[当前输入 x_t] --&gt; G1[遗忘门 f_t]&#10;    X --&gt; G2[输入门 i_t]&#10;    X --&gt; G3[输出门 o_t]&#10;    H[上一步隐状态 h_t-1] --&gt; G1&#10;    H --&gt; G2&#10;    H --&gt; G3&#10;    C[上一步细胞状态 c_t-1] --&gt; M1[逐元素乘 f_t]&#10;    G1 --&gt; M1&#10;    M1 --&gt; ADD[加法更新]&#10;    G2 --&gt; ADD&#10;    CT[候选记忆 c~_t] --&gt; ADD&#10;    ADD --&gt; C2[新细胞状态 c_t]&#10;    C2 --&gt; TANH[tanh 压缩]&#10;    TANH --&gt; M2[逐元素乘 o_t]&#10;    G3 --&gt; M2&#10;    M2 --&gt; H2[新隐状态 h_t]\">graph TD\n    X[当前输入 x_t] --&gt; G1[遗忘门 f_t]\n    X --&gt; G2[输入门 i_t]\n    X --&gt; G3[输出门 o_t]\n    H[上一步隐状态 h_t-1] --&gt; G1\n    H --&gt; G2\n    H --&gt; G3\n    C[上一步细胞状态 c_t-1] --&gt; M1[逐元素乘 f_t]\n    G1 --&gt; M1\n    M1 --&gt; ADD[加法更新]\n    G2 --&gt; ADD\n    CT[候选记忆 c~_t] --&gt; ADD\n    ADD --&gt; C2[新细胞状态 c_t]\n    C2 --&gt; TANH[tanh 压缩]\n    TANH --&gt; M2[逐元素乘 o_t]\n    G3 --&gt; M2\n    M2 --&gt; H2[新隐状态 h_t]</pre><p>图里只有一条贯穿的「细胞状态」主线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，三个门各自控制它的一段读写；正是这条主线上的加法路径，让梯度不必再经历反复相乘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"seq2seq-与多步预测\">seq2seq 与多步预测</h2><p>要一次预测未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 步，RNN 家族的主流做法是编码器-解码器（seq2seq）结构，这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/ts-problem-framing\">时间序列问题建模</a> 中推荐的「多输出策略」的具体实现。编码器逐步读入回看窗口，把整段历史压缩进最终隐状态（上下文向量）；解码器以此为起点，逐步生成未来各步。为缓解「把所有历史塞进一个固定向量」的瓶颈，注意力机制最早正是在 seq2seq 上提出的——让解码器每一步都能回看编码器的全部隐状态。这条线索一路演化，最终催生了完全抛弃循环的 <a href=\"transformers-ts\">时序 Transformer</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时仍该选-rnn\">何时仍该选 RNN</h2><p>在 Transformer 当道的 2026 年，LSTM 与 GRU 远未过时，反而在几类场景里是更务实的选择。其一是流式与在线预测：RNN 天然增量更新，来一个点更一次隐状态，延迟极低，适合 IoT 边缘设备；而 Transformer 通常要重算整个窗口。其二是小数据集：循环单元参数共享强、归纳偏置贴合序列，在数据稀缺时比 Transformer 更不易过拟合。其三是资源受限部署，相关权衡见 <a href=\"../applications/domains-deployment\">行业落地与部署</a>。需要并行训练、超长依赖或可扩展性时，则应转向 <a href=\"tcn-cnn\">时序卷积 TCN</a> 或 Transformer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RNN 用随时间更新的隐状态承载记忆，参数在所有时间步共享。</li>\n<li>朴素 RNN 受梯度消失之困，记不住远处依赖；LSTM 用门控+加法式细胞状态破解。</li>\n<li>GRU 是 LSTM 的轻量版，数据少时常更稳。</li>\n<li>多步预测用 seq2seq 编码器-解码器，注意力机制最早即源于此。</li>\n<li>流式、小数据、低延迟场景下，RNN 仍优于 Transformer。</li>\n<li>需要并行与超长依赖时，转向 <a href=\"tcn-cnn\">时序卷积 TCN</a> 与 <a href=\"transformers-ts\">时序 Transformer</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"循环网络 RNN 与 LSTM","id":"循环网络-rnn-与-lstm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"隐状态与时间展开","id":"隐状态与时间展开"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度消失与门控机制","id":"梯度消失与门控机制"},{"level":2,"text":"seq2seq 与多步预测","id":"seq2seq-与多步预测"},{"level":2,"text":"何时仍该选 RNN","id":"何时仍该选-rnn"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预处理与特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/foundations/preprocessing-features"},"next":{"title":"时序卷积 TCN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/architectures/tcn-cnn"}}